            "review_title": "Review at Suon Cay Nuong & Beer",
            "review_text": "Geoff\nLeigh-on Sea, United Kingdom226 contributions\n0\nGone down hill\nJan 2020 • Couples\nBeen here many times over a 12 year period... And decide to go back tonight... How sad its gone down. \nThe service was very poor we had to keep reminding the waitress what we ordered \nThey served are tiger beer put in on the table but forgot to take the bottle tops of.. \nBut the thing that surprised the most was the quality of the meat. ( very poor.) all ways when we have been here the main thing that brought us back wad the good quality of the meat and the flavour. \nBut unfortunately I think the owner has Decided to use a new supplier as the meat was so thin and had no flavour what so ever. \nAnd one more thing that surprised us was how quiet the restaurant. \nSo all in all we will not be going back and Pehaps it's time after 12 years to look for a new bq restaurant.. \nOne note. In this dog eat dog World. One thing you must never do is cut back on flavour and quality....... \nI would rather pay a little bit more and have good quality food. \nSo would I recommend this restaurant unfortunately no I can't... \n😞😞😞😞😞😞😞😞😞😞😞😞\n.\nRead more\nWritten January 14, 2020",
