            "review_text": "Hùng T\n2 contributions\n0\nTerrible service\nJun 2017 • Family\nWe come at around 7pm, the placed is crowded with Vietnamese, the staff was overwhelmed and kept on running around... We ordered 4 dish plus drinks and we started to feed our little kid. By the time she finished her meal, approximately 20 mins, our table was still empty. I mean EMPTY, without even a dish, bowl, glass or chopsticks... unbelievable. \n\nNext to us was a couple who came minutes after us and they have all their dishes served when we left... Never to return. We went back to Hun Khoi BBQ a few block away, an old place we visited frequently and the food as well as service was nice as usual. \n\nStrongly recommend to stay away.\nRead more\nWritten June 6, 2017",
