            "review_title": "Review at Suon Cay Nuong & Beer",
            "review_text": "Sally r\nLeicester, United Kingdom108 contributions\n0\nBit confusing...\nFeb 2017 • Couples\nDon't get me wrong - the food you get is tasty - BUT!\nIt's definitely a locals place & the English communication is 'broken' so it's hard to know what you're doing is correct. \nWe ordered ribs, wings & beef strips - you cook it in the table top BBQ & then eat as you go. \nThe wedges were cold & apparently we were supposed to put them on the BBQ too?... the waiter was great & it's basically a culture thing & it's just getting used to it. \nThe meat was delicious & im sure you would soon get used to the system if you came more than once. \nThe prices are cheap. The beer is really great value. \nIt's friendly & clean. \nGive it a go. !! Be brave & embrace a different way to eat?\nRead more\nWritten February 19, 2017",
