            "review_text": "Samra A\n7 contributions\n0\nQuick service and delicious meals\nSep 2016 • Couples\nI instantly fell in love with this place the first time I ate there. The food was simple but delicious. The waiters are very quick to deliver your order. I really liked the idea that they bring raw food and cook it infront of you on burning coal. We tried the different dishes. My recommendation is mince meat wrapped in beetle leaves and the potato salad. The potato salad is actually a potato sticks (crisp) salad. Which is a very different one and I just loved it. A must go for all grill food lovers\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 21, 2016",
