            "review_text": "Mai S\nTamarindo, Costa Rica364 contributions\n0\nTasty meat grill\nMar 2016 • Family\nOur family of 5 visited Suon Cay for lunch in March 2016 as it was up the street from our hotel. The prices were reasonable, service was excellent and food was delicious. We had a seafood bird's nest dish, beef with black pepper sauce and grilled vegetables. The staff grilled our food in front of us. The establishment was clean and atmospher pleasant. During the evening, the restaurant can get quite full though this was certainly not the case at lunch. We would return again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 19, 2016",
